Absorb Fork
===========

This build is a modified version of Absorb.

Upstream:  https://github.com/pounat/absorb
Copyright: (C) 2026 Nathan Poulson
License:   GNU General Public License, version 3 or later (see LICENSE),
           including the Additional Permission under GPLv3 Section 7.

Modifications in this fork (November 2026):
  - chapter-skip / playback-stall fixes, atomic cross-track chapter seeks
  - persistent cover cache with background warm-up
  - faster cold start (UI no longer blocks on the server handshake)
  - own application id (com.lw.absorb), app name, icon and signing key

The full corresponding source for every published binary is this repository,
at the same tag as the release.

